(7692743, 1260868, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congratulations on winning this challenge .. especially as she is no longer with you ... <br/>its a beautiful portrait .. not only of snowy but the beautiful background that sets her off so well .. <br/> <br/>i''m really sorry for called her ''it'' in my comment during voting .. i was 99.999% sure it was snowy .. and about 95% sure that she was a she .. i should have gone with my gut ... as calling any creature an it goes against the grain .. especially a beloved one ... <br/>a lesson for next time .. go with my gut .. <br/> <br/>anyway .. i''m very happy she got this blue ribbon ... a few years ago my little katee won a challenge and not that long after passed away .. it was a wonderful surprise that she won .. and wonderful to get the blue especially because she is no longer with me ..<br/>so i see a parallel with your snowy and my katee .. not exact .. but similar .. <br/>i''m sorry you still miss her so much .. means she was very loved .. :)<br/></td>', 'many congratulations on winning this challenge .. especially as she is no longer with you ... its a beautiful portrait .. not only of snowy but the beautiful background that sets her off so well ..  i''m really sorry for called her ''it'' in my comment during voting .. i was 99.999% sure it was snowy .. and about 95% sure that she was a she .. i should have gone with my gut ... as calling any creature an it goes against the grain .. especially a beloved one ... a lesson for next time .. go with my gut ..  anyway .. i''m very happy she got this blue ribbon ... a few years ago my little katee won a challenge and not that long after passed away .. it was a wonderful surprise that she won .. and wonderful to get the blue especially because she is no longer with me ..so i see a parallel with your snowy and my katee .. not exact .. but similar .. i''m sorry you still miss her so much .. means she was very loved .. :)', '2021-04-28 02:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
